者","真理之律者","腹黑女"],"concept_type":"Entity","description":"她是我的可靠战友。从圣芙蕾雅学园起就和我一起学习、战斗、闯祸。她总是默默地支持我，曾奉献理之律者的力量帮助我对抗支配之律者，后来成为了真理之律者。虽然她总叫我'草履虫'，但我知道她非常在乎大家。"}},"mem_links":[{"id":"01a0a7d3-29f0-4355-8364-449baf1d8559","from":"4decfc9f-8d23-40ac-8338-ac13a6a2fdc7","to":"6173191b-1bf9-4654-8f4d-ec59936cc32b","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"老师","confidence":0.85}}},{"id":"7faa5263-fcb3-4e54-b229-296e9920d9a0","from":"4decfc9f-8d23-40ac-8338-ac13a6a2fdc7","to":"a86c79b2-8b1d-42d7-8fe8-83c8c9f67615","intensity":0.9,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"参与","confidence":0.9}}},{"id":"fe7c876a-8162-4abf-a747-7c35add350ac","from":"4decfc9f-8d23-40ac-8338-ac13a6a2fdc7","to":"5757fd86-5448-46bc-8923-e0696f917511","intensity":0.8,"link_type":{"Sem":{"verb":"指导","confidence":0.8}}}]}},{"embedding":{"tag":[-0.010133626,0.023119528,0.04808244,-0.029100513,0.01802869,-0.07132392,-0.017178424,0.055177566,-0.00036461756,0.04001039,0.097761,-0.29207832,-0.035335105,-0.03635756,0.025703412,0.03405173,-0.032579903,-0.0021991879,0.030486692,-0.013874645,0.06759666,-0.07082673,0.007858709,0.0010065208,0.00519301,0.007339568,0.03201289,-0.07121139,-0.04808726,0.005251129,-0.015363831,0.04027479,-0.0029633176,0.021763971,0.049971767,0.030246297,0.024804631,-0.026573531,-0.022871446,0.022026818,-0.039628368,0.009019503,0.017970882,0.0044636643,-0.005750452,-0.017944884,-0.03967082,-0.001654,-0.006738026,-0.03035148,-0.027123922,0.049008198,-0.013768192,0.058459595,0.0033411914,-0.03162517,0.013876636,0.05866643,-0.01821963,0.0033799903,0.017279854,-0.022669423,-0.01941925,0.032568686,-0.02690283,0.0011085682,-0.029710034,-0.0011270377,0.012696186,0.02392758,-0.030933242,-0.014850661,-0.0050830157,-0.0385904,0.031345684,-0.060605396,-0.030023616,-0.015111566,-0.0066347774,-0.033606134,0.010827704,-0.0688127,-0.023374824,0.000106806634,-0.07094731,-0.024581335,-0.08327378,-0.0015718918,0.010685658,-0.01697203,0.023864126,-0.06168036,0.054144632,0.05678533,-0.018596765,0.02038759,-0.059481673,